            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks once a day for a new version on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cherche une nouvelle version sur GitHub une fois par jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks once a day for a new version on GitHub. Last checked %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cherche une nouvelle version sur GitHub une fois par jour. Dernière recherche %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Activity Yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jouer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play Super Metroid on This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jouez à Super Metroid sur ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview of the accent color": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperçu de la couleur d’accentuation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redémarrer maintenant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SM Launcher Plus": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SM Launcher Plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SM Launcher Plus installs SuperMetroidRecomp, a native port of Super Metroid, from your own ROM and keeps it up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SM Launcher Plus installe SuperMetroidRecomp, un portage natif de Super Metroid, à partir de votre propre ROM et le tient à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher le journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SuperMetroidRecomp on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SuperMetroidRecomp sur GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new language applies after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle langue s’applique après un redémarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ROM has been patched. Use an unmodified copy; mods are added in SM Launcher Plus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette ROM a été modifiée. Utilisez une copie intacte ; les mods s’ajoutent dans SM Launcher Plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ROM isn't the supported version. SM Launcher Plus needs Super Metroid (Japan, USA).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette ROM n’est pas la version prise en charge. SM Launcher Plus a besoin de Super Metroid (Japan, USA)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is the wrong size for a SNES ROM.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier n’a pas la bonne taille pour une ROM SNES."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the ROM of “%@”, not Super Metroid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est la ROM de « %@ », pas de Super Metroid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a SNES ROM. Choose a .sfc, .smc or .zip file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une ROM SNES. Choisissez un fichier .sfc, .smc ou .zip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This zip has no .sfc or .smc file in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce zip ne contient aucun fichier .sfc ou .smc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This zip holds more than one ROM. Choose the Super Metroid one on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce zip contient plus d’une ROM. Choisissez celle de Super Metroid seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unable to read this file. It may be damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de lire ce fichier. Il est peut-être endommagé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates are off in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour sont désactivées dans cette version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What SM Launcher Plus does is written here: downloads, installs, and each time the game starts or stops.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que fait SM Launcher Plus est noté ici : téléchargements, installations, et chaque démarrage ou arrêt du jeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ROM stays where it is. Nothing is uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre ROM reste où elle est. Rien n’est envoyé en ligne."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}